{"id": "q0019", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3417914541, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Bud makes homemade macaroni and cheese once a week.  The pasta costs $1.00 a box, and he spends $3.00 on cheddar cheese and twice that amount for the gruyere cheese.  How much money does Bud spend on making macaroni and cheese in one year?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0019.wav", "input_sha256": "acc2adc169c82adad9c606a2cc64cc2bbf1234e9e7a225b2cb51d0cf3fdc3679", "input_samples": 308800, "input_s": 19.3, "n_real_chunks": 20, "score": 0.3869, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Bud makes macaroni and cheese once a week. , Pasta: $1 , Cheddar cheese: $3 , Gruyere cheese: 2 × $3 = $6 Total per week: \\[ 1 + 3 + 6 = 10 \\] There are 52 weeks in one year: \\[ 10 \\times 52 = 520 \\] Final answer: 520", "expert_answer": "Bud makes macaroni and cheese **once a week**.\n\n- Pasta: **$1**\n- Cheddar cheese: **$3**\n- Gruyere cheese: **2 × $3 = $6**\n\nTotal per week:\n\n\\[\n1 + 3 + 6 = 10\n\\]\n\nThere are **52 weeks** in one year:\n\n\\[\n10 \\times 52 = 520\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: 520**", "transcript": "Bud makes homemade macaroni and cheese once a week. The pasta costs $1 a box, and he spends $3 on cheddar cheese and twice that amount for the Gruyere cheese. How much money does Bud spend on making macaroni and cheese in one year? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 4.23, "expert_s": 3.41, "expert_input_samples": 308800, "expert_input_s": 19.3, "expert_input_sha256": "acc2adc169c82adad9c606a2cc64cc2bbf1234e9e