{"id": "q0073", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2100720181, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Jackie grew 3\" over the summer.  She is now 2\" shorter than Anne, who is twice the size of Albert.  If Albert is 36\" tall, how tall was Jackie before summer?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0073.wav", "input_sha256": "561b9b4bbd5759fa5d23f4d63067fb11f2e84a6df7b09710ff4d4144d8abb3d3", "input_samples": 214000, "input_s": 13.375, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.3463, "act": 0.9979, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Albert is 36 inches tall. Ann is twice Albert’s height: \\[ 2 \\times 36 = 72 \\] So Ann is 72 inches tall. Jackie is now 2 inches shorter than Ann: \\[ 72 - 2 = 70 \\] So Jackie is now 70 inches tall. She grew 3 inches over the summer, so before summer she was: \\[ 70 - 3 = 67 \\] Final answer: 67", "expert_answer": "Albert is **36 inches** tall.\n\nAnn is twice Albert’s height:\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 36 = 72\n\\]\n\nSo Ann is **72 inches** tall.\n\nJackie is now 2 inches shorter than Ann:\n\n\\[\n72 - 2 = 70\n\\]\n\nSo Jackie is now **70 inches** tall.\n\nShe grew 3 inches over the summer, so before summer she was:\n\n\\[\n70 - 3 = 67\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: 67**", "transcript": "Jackie grew 3 inches over the summer. She is now 2 inches shorter than Ann, who is twice the size of Albert. If Albert is 36 inches tall, how tall was Jackie before summer? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.93, "expert_s": 2.8, "expert_input_samples": 214000, "expert_input_s": 13.375, "expert_input_sha256": "561b9b4bbd5759fa5d23f4d63067fb11f2e84a6df7b09710ff4d4144d8abb3d3", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.552, "relay_synth_ms": 17951, "onset_chunk": 13, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 312, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 312, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0073_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "240ddfe08b18b8596a496e7b2b1734f4a0e9a45b2270ca4c3edb162f60becccc", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 36.12}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0073_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "820971bda73f8a004b0e1a3a3e19b0219dd86d650953643b261cef5e20928823", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0073_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "efd02eaf0ec1a283f47ab5a7d0d2f0ec8ff4b5b623a5365b8b542bcd40995c48", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.04}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.106, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.064, 2.112, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.06, 3.107, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.059, 4.108, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.059, 5.107, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.067, 6.118, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.063, 7.114, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.063, 8.113, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.061, 9.111, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.063, 10.112, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.061, 11.111, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.064, 12.116, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.062, 13.111, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.375, 13.438, 14.069, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.375, 14.747, 15.244, 0, 24960, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 13.375, "last_real_feed_done": 13.438, "onset": 14.069, "gate_read_done": 14.069, "fire": 14.069, "candidate_first_pcm": 14.069, "stall_note": 14.071, "stall_first_pcm": 14.687, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 15.244, "expert_req": 14.071, "expert_resp": 17.796, "relay_synth_start": 17.796, "relay_first_pcm": 18.476, "relay_synth_end": 35.748, "first_any_pcm": 14.069, "first_answer_pcm": 18.476, "session_end": 35.968}, "ttfa_answer_s": 5.101, "ttfa_any_s": 0.694}
{"id": "q0091", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 230375063, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Aaron and Vanessa were relay race partners on a running team. Aaron was able to run each mile twice as fast as Vanessa, but Vanessa was able to run twice as far as Aaron did. If Vanessa ran 4 miles and Aaron completed his part of the race in 16 minutes, how long in minutes did Vanessa take to complete her part?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0091.wav", "input_sha256": "c9d30e32f0e214f9a7dea809ed5fa76c96786c710fb1e04c79f4c5680a2736cc", "input_samples": 372000, "input_s": 23.25, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.302, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Vanessa ran 4 miles, and she ran twice as far as Aaron. So Aaron ran: \\[ 4 \\div 2 = 2 \\text{ miles} \\] Aaron completed 2 miles in 16 minutes, so his speed was: \\[ \\frac{2}{16} = \\frac{1}{8} \\text{ mile per minute} \\] Aaron ran each mile twice as fast as Vanessa, so Vanessa’s speed was half of Aaron’s: \\[ \\frac{1}{8} \\div 2 = \\frac{1}{16} \\text{ mile per minute} \\] Vanessa’s time for 4 miles was: \\[ 4 \\div \\frac{1}{16} = 64 \\] Final answer: 64", "expert_answer": "Vanessa ran **4 miles**, and she ran twice as far as Aaron.\n\nSo Aaron ran:\n\n\\[\n4 \\div 2 = 2 \\text{ miles}\n\\]\n\nAaron completed 2 miles in 16 minutes, so his speed was:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{2}{16} = \\frac{1}{8} \\text{ mile per minute}\n\\]\n\nAaron ran each mile twice as fast as Vanessa, so Vanessa’s speed was half of Aaron’s:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{8} \\div 2 = \\frac{1}{16} \\text{ mile per minute}\n\\]\n\nVanessa’s time for 4 miles was:\n\n\\[\n4 \\div \\frac{1}{16} = 64\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: 64**", "transcript": "Aaron and Vanessa were relay race partners on a running team. Aaron was able to run each mile twice as fast as Vanessa, but Vanessa was able to run twice as far as Aaron did. If Vanessa ran 4 miles and Aaron completed his part of the race in 16 minutes, how long in minutes did Vanessa take to comple", "asr_s": 1.37, "expert_s": 4.16, "expert_input_samples": 372000, "expert_input_s": 23.25, "expert_input_sha256": "c9d30e32f0e214f9a7dea809ed5fa76c96786c710fb1e04c79f4c5680a2736cc", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.662, "relay_synth_ms": 116232, "onset_chunk": 23, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0091_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "617b4d15f8cced66ca74053ac2667e11c8f91a3923b285da4a487b30807f363c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 242.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0091_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "02cb19167c5b623db74753ed919dc79b969711d48c238c4219c2bc0ec473dfdf", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0091_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "f033aff7e112a62037a744ec88d8aa2cffbdcd355c50ca9d21d576e8eb416273", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.106, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.08, 2.142, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.072, 3.14, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.078, 4.141, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.077, 5.142, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.079, 6.142, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.08, 7.145, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.081, 8.147, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.08, 9.144, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.082, 10.148, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.083, 11.148, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.084, 12.149, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.083, 13.149, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.083, 14.149, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.084, 15.15, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.083, 16.149, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.083, 17.15, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.083, 18.209, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.087, 19.153, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.082, 20.146, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.086, 21.154, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.085, 22.151, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.087, 23.152, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 23.25, 23.336, 24.144, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 23.25, "last_real_feed_done": 23.336, "onset": 24.144, "gate_read_done": 24.145, "fire": 24.145, "candidate_first_pcm": 24.144, "stall_note": 24.147, "stall_first_pcm": 25.009, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 25.009, "expert_req": 24.147, "expert_resp": 29.67, "relay_synth_start": 29.671, "relay_first_pcm": 30.351, "relay_synth_end": 145.904, "first_any_pcm": 24.144, "first_answer_pcm": 30.351, "session_end": 146.936}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.101, "ttfa_any_s": 0.894}
{"id": "q0107", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 886590172, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "The binary number $10101001110_{2}$ is equal to what number in base eight?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0107.wav", "input_sha256": "277432346d46c23d4f439a20dae8ef9e389b5b8a4e12c678ef0c525cdbca2632", "input_samples": 140400, "input_s": 8.775, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.8471, "act": 0.9997, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The given “binary” number 1010101102 is not valid in base 2, because binary numbers can only contain 0 and 1. So it cannot be converted to base 8 as a binary number.", "expert_answer": "The given “binary” number **1010101102** is **not valid in base 2**, because binary numbers can only contain **0** and **1**.\n\nSo it **cannot be converted to base 8 as a binary number**.", "transcript": "The binary number 1 0 1 0 1 0 1 1 0 2 is equal to what number in base 8? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.75, "expert_s": 2.92, "expert_input_samples": 140400, "expert_input_s": 8.775, "expert_input_sha256": "277432346d46c23d4f439a20dae8ef9e389b5b8a4e12c678ef0c525cdbca2632", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.19, "relay_synth_ms": 8386, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0107_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "d391662fbeb817abd3b7833d0000b51eb7c28edeae9135d852b1c7383061c6af", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 12.32}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0107_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "14ef1b4