{"id": "q0254", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3537916282, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "You bought a limousine for $98,000 and are planning to rent it for weddings, ceremonies and parties at $245 per hour. If you estimate the car will be hired for 2 hours a day on average, with daily costs at about $50, what is the estimated yearly yield on your investment if you work all year round, i.e. every day of the year, including any festivities and weekends?\n\nA. 150%\nB. 0.45%\nC. 0.164%\nD. 1.64%\nE. 183%\nF. 2.45%\nG. 245%\nH. 164%\nI. 75%\nJ. 200%\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0254.wav", "input_sha256": "b1a9e32a7e1cee67166e18580ae4c6a2b97ee83203eecad24be0756791da3407", "input_samples": 606000, "input_s": 37.875, "n_real_chunks": 38, "score": 0.7683, "act": 0.9996, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "None of the listed options. The estimated yearly yield is about 164%. Calculation: \\((245 \\times 2 - 50) \\times 365 \\div 98{,}000 \\approx 1.639 = 164\\%\\).", "expert_answer": "None of the listed options. The estimated yearly yield is **about 164%**.\n\nCalculation: \\((245 \\times 2 - 50) \\times 365 \\div 98{,}000 \\approx 1.639 = 164\\%\\).", "transcript": "You bought a limousine for $98,000 and are planning to rent it for weddings, ceremonies, and parties at $245 per hour. If you estimate the car will be hired for two hours a day on average, with daily costs at about $50, what is the estimated yearly yield on your investment if you work all year round", "asr_s": 2.13, "expert_s": 9.7, "expert_input_samples": 606000, "expert_input_